WEBVTT

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:25.784
So... I guess there's
only one thing left to say.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:29.004
[mimics robotic servos]

00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:32.051
It's been a real drag.

00:00:32.747 --> 00:00:34.227
Thanks for nothing.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.023
[birds chirping faintly]

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.549
[coughing]

00:00:52.811 --> 00:00:53.986
Sonic, look.

00:01:04.213 --> 00:01:06.085
Shadow and Robotnik.

00:01:06.259 --> 00:01:08.479
They sacrificed
themselves...

00:01:08.653 --> 00:01:10.655
to save everyone.

00:01:11.394 --> 00:01:13.440
You always have a choice.

00:01:14.702 --> 00:01:17.444
Guys, I'm really sorry
for running off like that.

00:01:17.618 --> 00:01:19.228
I shouldn't have
left you behind.

00:01:21.013 --> 00:01:22.623
The truth is...

00:01:22.797 --> 00:01:25.452
you're the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.

00:01:27.193 --> 00:01:29.021
And the best friends.

00:01:29.195 --> 00:01:31.066
Can you ever forgive me?

00:01:35.157 --> 00:01:36.942
Team Sonic?

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:43.644
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?

00:01:51.957 --> 00:01:53.567
Goodbye, Doctor.

00:02:10.105 --> 00:02:12.412
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!

00:02:13.935 --> 00:02:16.372
Now that's
what I call teamwork.

00:02:16.547 --> 00:02:18.331
Okay! It's ready!

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:19.985
[munching]

00:02:20.159 --> 00:02:21.334
[gasps]

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.162
Knuckles,
how could you?

00:02:23.336 --> 00:02:25.164
Gotta be faster than that!

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:27.166
Give me a break.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.646
Still moving a little slow
over here.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.604
- Donut Lord!
- Yay!

00:02:30.778 --> 00:02:32.301
[pained groan]

00:02:32.475 --> 00:02:35.130
Okay, Knuckles, that's... I am having the love.

00:02:35.304 --> 00:02:36.654
[barks]
I want the love!

00:02:36.828 --> 00:02:39.526
[Tails] Aww... Get in here, Ozzy.

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.397
It's great
to be back together.

00:02:41.572 --> 00:02:43.399
We're stronger than ever.

00:02:43.574 --> 00:02:46.011
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:51.190
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.

00:03:00.242 --> 00:03:03.245
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,

00:03:03.419 --> 00:03:04.595
it's the Blue Blur!

00:03:04.769 --> 00:03:06.509
Often imitated,
never duplicated,

00:03:06.684 --> 00:03:07.902
the one, the only...

00:03:08.076 --> 00:03:08.816
[yells]

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:10.470
Let's do this!

00:03:10.644 --> 00:03:12.820
Yeah! [laughs]

00:03:12.994 --> 00:03:16.084
[yells]
All right, boys,
try and keep up.

00:03:16.781 --> 00:03:18.652
[all cheering, whooping]

00:03:23.178 --> 00:03:26.181
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]

00:05:12.505 --> 00:05:16.030
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:17.728
Tails?

00:05:18.293 --> 00:05:19.817
Knuckles?

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:24.430
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.

00:05:28.347 --> 00:05:29.827
[electronic whirring]

00:05:33.352 --> 00:05:36.355
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?

00:05:38.879 --> 00:05:40.620
[weapon powering up]

00:05:41.403 --> 00:05:43.405
[beeping]

00:05:47.758 --> 00:05:48.846
[Sonic] Pro tip:

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.238
If you're gonna take a shot

00:05:50.412 --> 00:05:52.545
at the fastest creature
in the universe...

00:05:54.895 --> 00:05:56.505
you'd better not miss.

00:06:00.335 --> 00:06:02.947
Um... I'm flattered
by the cosplay,

00:06:03.121 --> 00:06:04.818
but you got
a few details wrong.

00:06:04.992 --> 00:06:07.865
I can't blame you, though.
It's hard to copy perfection.

00:06:17.962 --> 00:06:19.964
That's a neat trick.

00:06:28.581 --> 00:06:29.800
[Sonic yelps]

00:06:31.889 --> 00:06:33.804
What? Who are you?

